{
  "name": "YT Agent - Part 2 - Render Engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "PART 2 - Render Engine\nWebhook receives the plan -> ElevenLabs narration -> Drive. Then a loop, one scene at a time: image (OpenAI) -> Drive -> Kling image2video with callback_url = this execution's resume URL -> Wait node sleeps until Kling calls back (async). Status is re-checked; if Kling called on 'processing', it polls every 20s until succeed/failed.\nWhen all 6 clips are ready they are POSTed to Part 3.\nSetup: Drive folder ID, ElevenLabs voice ID, Part 3 URL.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        16,
        -80
      ],
